@startuml F7.6-D02-reentregar-outbox
title F7.6-D02 — Reentregar evento FAILED/DEAD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "OutboxController" as Ctrl
participant "RetryOutboxEventUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Reentregar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/outbox/{id}/reentrega
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT FOR UPDATE\n→ PENDING tentativas=0
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: toast reenfileirado

@enduml
